Senator Imee R. Marcos: It's very, very clear in the Constitution.

129
00:21:48,940 --> 00:21:56,180
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So what is the constitutional basis for modifying statutory qualifications for retirement benefits

130
00:21:56,180 --> 00:21:58,320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: through an annual appropriations?

131
00:21:58,440 --> 00:22:00,700
Senator Imee R. Marcos: This law, this is not on.

132
