00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:30,400
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: the Retirement Law of the Office of the Ombudsman.

139
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:34,440
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: It does not seek to amend the seven-year term limit for the Ombudsman

140
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:37,680
Senator Joseph Victor "JV" G. Ejercito: under the 1987 Constitution.

141
00:22:38,320 --> 00:22:41,720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: No, we understand that the provision only applies to the Ombudsman,

142
00:22:41,840 --> 00:22:44,960
Senator Imee R. Marcos: the Deputy Ombudsman, and the Special Prosecutors,

143
00:22:45,060 --> 00:22:46,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: and not to the others,

144
00:22:46,460 --> 00:22:49,460
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which arguably makes it worse because it's preferential.

145
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:52,800
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the question will arise,

146
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:54,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: is Boeing intending to retire?

147
