Senator Imee R. Marcos: I think not.

148
00:22:55,820 --> 00:22:58,320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: So, why was this proposed?

149
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Why was this proposed?

150
00:22:59,320 --> 00:23:05,380
Senator Imee R. Marcos: I think I would like to cite also the case of Pimentel III v. the House of Representatives,

151
00:23:06,020 --> 00:23:10,880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: decided very recently, as a matter of fact, on the 3rd of December 2025.

152
00:23:11,700 --> 00:23:17,860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: And the Supreme Court reiterated this absolute prohibition against amending substantive laws

153
00:23:17,860 --> 00:23:19,200
Senator Imee R. Marcos: through the GAA.

154
00:23:19,920 --> 00:23:23,480
Senator Imee R. Marcos: How can we reconcile the special provision with this ruling?

155
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:23,600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Okay.

156
00:23:25,720 --> 00:23:27,520
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Hindi po pwede yan eh.

157
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:27,880
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kasi,

158
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,500
