165
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:51,320
Senator Imee R. Marcos: through separate legislation

166
00:23:51,320 --> 00:23:54,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: para walang duda, walang tanong,

167
00:23:54,500 --> 00:23:56,120
Senator Imee R. Marcos: instead of a special provision

168
00:23:56,120 --> 00:23:57,860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: na parang pinalusot lamang.

169
00:23:57,880 --> 00:24:00,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Sa ating GAA,

170
00:24:00,240 --> 00:24:04,060
Senator Imee R. Marcos: which is a general law that cannot amend a specific or special law.

171
