5251
06:18:01,520 --> 06:18:03,760
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At in that instance po, Mr. President.

5252
06:18:04,200 --> 06:18:17,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Okay po. Halimbawa po, kulang yung 50,000. Hindi po ba yung gagawin ng paraan ng DSWD kapag gaganon pong merong kahindik-hindik na pangyayari?

5253
06:18:19,440 --> 06:18:26,420
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Actually po, yung tanong niyo, Mr. President, ay tumpak doon sa kayang gawin ng social work.

5254
06:18:26,520 --> 06:18:36,680
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung worker ng DSWD. Doon sa social intake, pag sa tansya po niya, hindi talaga kakasya ang kinakailangang funeral assistance ng isang individual in crisis.

5255
06:18:37,120 --> 06:18:46,640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hindi kakasya sa 50,000. Kaya pala po niyang i-override yung 50,000 pesos upper limit at dagdagan po, Mr. President.

5256
06:18:46,640 --> 06:18:54,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: So napakagandang balita po niyan dahil sa dami po ng kalamidad natin dito sa bayan natin, pagkasana po sa mga kasong...

5257
06:18:54,640 --> 06:19:01,760
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Alam niyo naman po, kapag ka-biktima ka ng kalamidad, lahat na kabuhayan mo, kaari-arian mo, apiktado.

5258
06:19:02,340 --> 06:19:14,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung pong, yung pong, halimbawa po, yung mga puninarya at yung mga hospital po, yung mga tinatawag po nating service providers.

5259
06:19:14,900 --> 06:19:18,760
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: O po, yung po ba nababayaran natin yun sa tamang oras po?

5260
06:19:24,640 --> 06:19:32,800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ayon po sa department, Mr. President, basta't napapadala ng ospital ang bill on time at kumpleto po yung support yung documents,

5261
06:19:32,920 --> 06:19:36,140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: o po, nababayaran nila ng department in time.

5262
06:19:36,600 --> 06:19:44,720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung exception po ay yung problematic situation noong 2024 na pinag-usapan kanina kasama ni Sen. Lacasaw, Mr. President.

5263
06:19:44,900 --> 06:19:49,740
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: O po, o po. Bali ngayon po, wala na pong suliranin doon. Talagang nababayaran na po kaagad.

5264
06:19:50,040 --> 06:19:51,540
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sa ngayon, o po, Mr. President.

5265
06:19:51,540 --> 06:19:53,720
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: O po, sa buong Pilipinas po yun.

5266
06:19:54,640 --> 06:19:58,900
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Meron po kasi kami dito pagdating doon.

5267
06:19:58,900 --> 06:20:05,380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yes, well, salamat po, Mr. President, kung i-enlighten niyo po kami sa mga sitwasyon na hindi.

5268
06:20:05,640 --> 06:20:11,000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero to the best of his knowledge, ngayong gabi, Mr. President, ng Secretary, oo.

5269
06:20:11,340 --> 06:20:19,060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: But kung may mga sitwasyon na hindi pala yun ang nangyayari, the department is very willing to hear about it from the good gentleman

5270
06:20:19,060 --> 06:20:22,500
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para kanila pong matugunan at maiwas to, Mr. President.

5271
06:20:22,560 --> 06:20:24,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: O po, kasi ang DSWD po.

5272
06:20:24,640 --> 06:20:29,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung madalas naming lapitan na humihingi po kami ng guarantee letters.

5273
06:20:31,440 --> 06:20:37,780
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Tungkol naman po doon sa binawasan ang budget ng AICS, di ba po malungkot ito?

5274
06:20:42,580 --> 06:20:52,280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sabi po ng department, dahil sa kanilang pananaw, ang programang AICS sa ngayon ay tumutugon sa mga service gaps, malungkot nga daw po.

5275
06:20:52,280 --> 06:20:54,140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Of course, may ibang wisdom pa.

5276
06:20:54,640 --> 06:21:04,620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At kaya po, bagamat sa committee report natin, nadagdagan yung NEP, pero mas mababa po siya sa gab, Mr. President.

5277
06:21:05,480 --> 06:21:07,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Napaka-shape din naman ang answer na.

5278
06:21:08,700 --> 06:21:16,080
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero bukas pong representasyong itong, ano, duminig at tumugon sa mga follow-up questions, Mr. President.

5279
06:21:16,140 --> 06:21:16,740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ano lang po ba?

5280
06:21:16,740 --> 06:21:18,560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ito yung interest of pag-improve po ng budget.

5281
06:21:18,560 --> 06:21:23,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano po kaya, aming ginang sponsor, wala po bang maapektuhan doon?

5282
06:21:24,640 --> 06:21:33,060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ayon sa department, Mr. President, of course, opo, may maapektuhan.

5283
06:21:33,520 --> 06:21:37,060
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Hindi po ba yung pwedeng mapakibusapan?

5284
06:21:37,060 --> 06:21:43,000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero in fairness din po sa Senate, binigay naman po natin ang request nila sa NEP. At tinigitan pa, di ba?

5285
06:21:43,340 --> 06:21:50,360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil po sa NEP, Mr. President, maalala natin, ang value po doon ay P33,292,000,000.

5286
06:21:50,360 --> 06:21:54,200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Plus, sa committee report natin po sa Senado, Mr. President,

5287
06:21:54,640 --> 06:21:56,920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: itinaas po natin sa P48,198,000,000.

5288
06:21:56,920 --> 06:22:01,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: So hindi po totoo itong, itong chismis na ito na binaba? Hindi po totoo?

5289
06:22:04,600 --> 06:22:07,980
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Binaba po mula sa House version, Mr. President.

5290
06:22:09,220 --> 06:22:10,840
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Tapos dito po sa atin, tinaas na.

5291
06:22:12,580 --> 06:22:16,320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Binaba from the House version po. Mas mataas lamang po siya sa NEP.

5292
06:22:16,840 --> 06:22:19,720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero mas mababa po kaysa sa NEP.

5293
06:22:19,720 --> 06:22:24,620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sa mas maintindihan po ng ating taong bayan,

5294
06:22:24,640 --> 06:22:26,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: mababa po o mataas?

5295
06:22:30,320 --> 06:22:36,560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Overall, kumpara sa last year, mas mababa po siya, Mr. President.

5296
06:22:37,400 --> 06:22:40,300
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil yung gaaw po ay P63,000,000,000.

5297
06:22:40,440 --> 06:22:45,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano po ang solusyon natin doon sa maapektuhan po? Ano po ang maaring maging solusyon?

5298
06:22:48,040 --> 06:22:51,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Para pong nagkakaroon kami ng dialogue dito ni Secretary, Mr. President.

5299
06:22:51,860 --> 06:22:54,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero sa totoo, dumudulog po sila sa atin.

5300
06:22:54,640 --> 06:22:57,460
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dito sa Senado na itaas po ulit yung value po.

5301
06:22:57,460 --> 06:22:59,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Hindi po pwede pakiusapan si SP?

5302
06:23:01,520 --> 06:23:02,440
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Brotherly love?

5303
06:23:03,600 --> 06:23:09,500
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Binabasa po ng good gentleman ang isip ng sponsor na in the spirit of brotherly love daw.

5304
06:23:10,520 --> 06:23:13,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero sa buong institusyon ay magkaroon daw ng dialogue.

5305
06:23:13,940 --> 06:23:18,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Insya Allah, insya Allah. Magkaroon po ng pagbabago hanggat hindi pa pinal.

5306
06:23:19,580 --> 06:23:23,320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Dahil naniniwala po tayo sa mga programa ng DSWD.

5307
06:23:24,120 --> 06:23:24,360
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Thank you.

5308
06:23:24,360 --> 06:23:26,360
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nararamdaman po kasi tan-tao ito.

5309
06:23:27,980 --> 06:23:35,540
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nakakarating po sa ground. Nakakarating doon sa matatawag po nating nasa pinakamababang sitwasyon.

5310
06:23:37,160 --> 06:23:38,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Tanong ko lang po ulit.

5311
06:23:39,520 --> 06:23:45,460
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ako po kasi ay merong panukala patungkol sa mga senior citizen.

5312
06:23:46,400 --> 06:23:49,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi ang nanay ko po ay 92 years old na.

5313
06:23:49,120 --> 06:23:52,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Meron po siyang demensya.

5314
06:23:53,140 --> 06:23:54,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At ito lang pong nakaraan.

5315
06:23:54,360 --> 06:23:56,740
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ilang beses kami bumalik sa ospital.

5316
06:23:57,720 --> 06:24:00,780
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Magmula po sa dalawang caregiver.

5317
06:24:01,020 --> 06:24:06,040
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ngayon binigyan pa kami ng doktor ng order na tatlong caregiver. May nurse pa.

5318
06:24:07,020 --> 06:24:17,880
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: So, ako po ay nagdudugo ang puso ko kapag dumadaan po ko sa kalsada na hindi na po mga pulubing bata ang nakikita ko.

5319
06:24:18,800 --> 06:24:21,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung di mga senior citizen na po. Lolo, lola.

5320
06:24:22,820 --> 06:24:23,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano po ba ang programa?

5321
06:24:24,360 --> 06:24:27,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang programa natin sa DSWD para sa mga senior citizen.

5322
06:24:27,980 --> 06:24:28,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano po?

5323
06:24:28,400 --> 06:24:54,340
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano po ba ang drama natin sa DSWD para sa mga senior citizen?

5324
06:24:54,360 --> 06:25:04,180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. President, ang department po ay mayroong pong apat na dedicated na senior shelters all over the country.

5325
06:25:04,600 --> 06:25:12,320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kapag po may nadatnaan or may iulat sa department na, kunyari, homeless na senior citizen,

5326
06:25:12,820 --> 06:25:18,960
Senator Risa Hontiveros: nire-rescue po nila sila mula sa lansangan at dinadala po sa mga shelter na ito, Mr. President.

5327
06:25:18,960 --> 06:25:23,700
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sino po ang kapartner po ng DSWD sa pag-rescue?

5328
06:25:23,700 --> 06:25:25,060
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Local government po ba?

5329
06:25:35,080 --> 06:25:41,940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. President, at least po sa mga metropolitan areas sa Manila at saka po sa Cebu,

5330
06:25:42,380 --> 06:25:46,420
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kahit nga po devolved na yung social welfare function ng governance,

5331
06:25:47,160 --> 06:25:53,660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: inako pa rin po ng DSWD yung tungkulin na i-rescue ang isang,

5332
06:25:53,700 --> 06:25:57,360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ang mga senior citizen mula sa lansangan at dalhin sila sa shelter.

5333
06:25:57,700 --> 06:26:06,220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kahit po actually LGU function po ito, pero inangkin na rin po nila, inako po nila yung tungkulin.

5334
06:26:06,300 --> 06:26:11,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At ito po yung, ito pong apat na dedicated na senior shelters all over the country,

5335
06:26:11,480 --> 06:26:15,660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa ilalim po ng tinatawag na pag-abot program ng DSWD.

5336
06:26:15,740 --> 06:26:21,280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Rescue, pagdala sa shelter, and then paghatid sa kanila ulit sa kanilang tahanan, Mr. President.

5337
06:26:23,700 --> 06:26:27,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Saan po yung kalagayan ng pasilidad po? Saan po itong pasilidad?

5338
06:26:46,620 --> 06:26:51,660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. President, kaya po humihingi ng dagdag na pondo ang department para sa care facilities

5339
06:26:51,660 --> 06:26:54,640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: dahil kailangan din pong i-upgrade.

5340
06:26:55,260 --> 06:27:04,380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Medyo luma na po itong apat na senior shelters at sila po yung nakalocate sa NCR at Regions 4, 8, 9, at 11.

5341
06:27:05,100 --> 06:27:14,020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Nakita recently ni Secretary yung dalawa sa apat na ito at talaga pong bagamat maayos,

5342
06:27:14,180 --> 06:27:16,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: pero kailangan pong i-upgrade, Mr. President.

5343
06:27:17,500 --> 06:27:20,380
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kamusta po yung populasyon niya sa ngayon?

5344
06:27:20,380 --> 06:27:25,880
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ito po ba ay punong-puno o kailangan ng palakihin?

5345
06:28:00,630 --> 06:28:16,920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. President, magsu-submit po ang DSWD ng breakdown ng occupancy ng apat na residences. Pero sa apat na residential care facilities for older persons, 687 total.

5346
06:28:16,920 --> 06:28:44,340
Senator Risa Hontiveros: 309 ay mga lalaki at 378 ay mga babae. Full occupancy na po ang apat na ito. Kaya kapag overcapacity na ay i-farm out ang ilang residente sa private care facilities at babayaran ng department ang cost ng pagtira nila doon, Mr. President.

5347
06:28:44,340 --> 06:28:48,620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung mga private, parang nursing homes po iyan, ano?

5348
06:28:48,620 --> 06:28:49,960
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Opo.

5349
06:28:49,960 --> 06:28:52,880
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Parang shelters or nursing homes, Mr. President?

5350
06:28:52,960 --> 06:28:53,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Opo.

5351
06:28:53,720 --> 06:28:57,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yun naman po ay pasado sa DSWD.

5352
06:28:58,760 --> 06:29:04,020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pasado po, Mr. President, dahil sa mga accredited private care facilities lamang

5353
06:29:04,020 --> 06:29:09,520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: i-rehome ng department yung mga senior residents nila?

5354
06:29:09,940 --> 06:29:19,040
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi po, papunta dito sa Senado, galing ng Fairview, galing sa bahay namin,

5355
06:29:19,660 --> 06:29:20,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ilang beses po yan.

5356
06:29:20,780 --> 06:29:22,080
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Araw-araw po yan.

5357
06:29:22,580 --> 06:29:27,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nadadaanan ko po yung mga lola at lolo dito sa Maynila.

5358
06:29:27,920 --> 06:29:31,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ito po yung nakikiraan naman po ko sa idol natin na si Mayor Isko.

5359
06:29:31,480 --> 06:29:32,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Magaling po yan si Mayor Isko.

5360
06:29:33,060 --> 06:29:37,320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pero diyan po sa papuntang Ruas Boulevard, pagkaliwa mo,

5361
06:29:38,260 --> 06:29:39,520
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: andyan po yung may mga...

5362
06:29:39,520 --> 06:29:43,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Araw-araw po yan na nandun yung baka po pwedeng magawan po ninyo ng paraan

5363
06:29:43,640 --> 06:29:47,220
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: na kawawa naman po yung mga lolo at lola doon

5364
06:29:47,220 --> 06:29:51,340
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: na kahit umuulan, namamalimos, nagbebenta ng sampagita.

5365
06:29:51,900 --> 06:29:55,300
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kahit po sa Quezon Boulevard, nakahilera po sila doon.

5366
06:29:56,500 --> 06:29:57,460
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kawawa po talaga.

5367
06:30:00,000 --> 06:30:29,980
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you very much.

5368
06:30:30,020 --> 06:30:40,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Temporarily, tumira muna sa shelter. Pero pag susumikapan talaga nilang i-reintegrate sila sa kanilang mga pamilya.

5369
06:30:40,780 --> 06:30:50,120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And kaugnay din po ito, Mr. President, kalakhan po kasi ng mga cases ng mga seniors in street situation ay naliligaw.

5370
06:30:50,900 --> 06:30:59,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung iba sa kanila may demensya at LGU po ay inihahatid nila sa kanilang pamilya para nga po dun sa family reunification.

5371
06:31:00,000 --> 06:31:12,800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At kaya rin po siguro yung kanina nabanggit ko po yung population ng older person sa mga DSWD care facilities ay nasa hundreds lamang po, 687 total.

5372
06:31:13,600 --> 06:31:21,180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya po yung demand for elderly residences ay mababa at need pong i-upgrade itong mga residences na ito.

5373
06:31:21,500 --> 06:31:28,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Siguro may preference pa rin for family reunification where possible and doable po, Mr. President.

5374
06:31:28,480 --> 06:31:29,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sa karanasan po lang.

5375
06:31:30,000 --> 06:31:50,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Namin ginang sponsor sa nakakausap po namin kasi marami po sa mga matatanda ay hindi na tinatanggap sa kanilang pamilya dahil yun nga po parang mabigat na at yung iba naman po kailangan magtrabaho.

5376
06:31:50,320 --> 06:31:55,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung mga anak nila, ano nila, naiiwan na po yung...

5377
06:31:56,760 --> 06:31:58,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sa akin po, ano po talaga ito.

5378
06:31:58,720 --> 06:31:59,120
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sana po ma...

5379
06:32:00,000 --> 06:32:02,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maharap ninyo dahil...

5380
06:32:03,580 --> 06:32:04,820
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kaawa-awa po talaga.

5381
06:32:05,220 --> 06:32:05,540
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo.

5382
06:32:07,160 --> 06:32:09,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sunod ko na lang pong tanong, paano po yung trabaho?

5383
06:32:09,560 --> 06:32:20,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero Mr. President, bago po magpatuloy ang Good Gentleman, nakikiisa po kaming lahat dito, itong representasyon, ang department, sa habag nararamdaman ng Good Gentleman.

5384
06:32:20,780 --> 06:32:29,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At sabi nga po ni Secretary habang sinasalay sa inyo po ito, sa mga malulungkot na sitwasyon na hindi na po nakakayaman,

5385
06:32:30,000 --> 06:32:38,740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: o nagiging sustainable yung family reunification para sa mga elderly in street situations, kukukupin po talaga ng department.

5386
06:32:39,020 --> 06:32:43,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil ang bawat matanda po dapat ay may tahanan, Mr. President.

5387
06:32:43,480 --> 06:32:44,100
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo. Salamat po.

5388
06:32:44,880 --> 06:32:56,380
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung po bang NCSC, yung National Commission of Senior Citizens, ano po ang kanilang nagagawa patungkol dito?

5389
06:32:56,380 --> 06:32:58,380
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: O pwede lamang po bang...

5390
06:33:00,000 --> 06:33:02,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pwede lamang po bang...

5391
06:34:00,000 --> 06:34:06,040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Marami-rami po at varied ang partnerships po ng National Commission on Senior Citizens.

5392
06:34:06,040 --> 06:34:10,340
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hindi lang po sa ibang mga government agencies, pati po sa private sector.

5393
06:34:10,700 --> 06:34:14,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Halimbawa po sa Integrated Bar of the Philippines.

5394
06:34:15,140 --> 06:34:18,900
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tapos sa mga government agencies sa CICC.

5395
06:34:19,260 --> 06:34:24,340
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Halimbawa para labanan yung mga scams na bumibiktima sa mga senior citizens.

5396
06:34:24,760 --> 06:34:28,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: May partnership din po sila sa Department of Agriculture.

5397
06:34:28,260 --> 06:34:29,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pati sa DPWH.

5398
06:34:30,000 --> 06:34:35,160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Para maging senior citizen friendly din po yung mga infrastruktura sa ating mga syudad

5399
06:34:35,160 --> 06:34:42,220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at yung mga gusali din po na pinapasukan, ginagamit din ng ating mga senior citizens.

5400
06:34:42,420 --> 06:34:48,120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So marami-rami po yung mga partnerships and ongoing programs nila sa mga government

5401
06:34:48,120 --> 06:34:50,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at sa private sector organizations, Mr. President.

5402
06:34:53,100 --> 06:34:59,020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Meron pong pagkakataon po ba na nakaikot din po ba sila sa mga private nursing homes

5403
06:34:59,020 --> 06:35:03,020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: at sinek po nila yung kalagayan ng mga senior doon?

5404
06:35:13,540 --> 06:35:23,060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung mga hindi po maayos na residence facilities ay mga hindi accredited ng DSWD.

5405
06:35:23,060 --> 06:35:28,300
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Na ang department po kasi ang may jurisdiction po sa kanila.

5406
06:35:29,020 --> 06:35:32,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hindi po ang roles with the National Commission on Senior Citizens.

5407
06:35:33,220 --> 06:35:44,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So accredited lamang po yung mga private centers for older persons na iniikutan po ng DSWD para i-monitor.

5408
06:35:44,900 --> 06:35:49,720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At ang kabuang bilang po ng mga ito, accredited private centers for older persons,

5409
06:35:49,840 --> 06:35:52,620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ay labin lima sa buong bansa natin, Mr. President.

5410
06:35:53,080 --> 06:35:58,620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pwede po bang humiling sa grupo ng NCS?

5411
06:35:59,020 --> 06:36:03,360
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Meron pong kasabihan tayong walking the extra mile.

5412
06:36:04,360 --> 06:36:07,380
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi kung lagi po tayong nandun lang sa mandato,

5413
06:36:10,340 --> 06:36:12,740
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: sayang po ang pagiging public servant natin.

5414
06:36:12,880 --> 06:36:20,160
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sana kung meron po silang extra time sa makita din po nila yung mga nursing homes.

5415
06:36:21,280 --> 06:36:23,840
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung ano pong sitwasyon, umikot din po sila.

5416
06:36:25,640 --> 06:36:28,840
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi hindi po trabaho ng opisina namin maghanap.

5417
06:36:29,020 --> 06:36:30,220
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maghanap ng senior citizen.

5418
06:36:30,400 --> 06:36:31,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pero nagiging trabaho po namin.

5419
06:36:33,080 --> 06:36:36,200
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At isa din po dyan, yung patungkol sa mga PDL.

5420
06:36:37,420 --> 06:36:39,680
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung mga nakakulong po ng mga matatanda din.

5421
06:36:39,820 --> 06:36:44,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Sana meron din po kayong pagkakataon na mabisita po ninyo.

5422
06:36:45,580 --> 06:36:47,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi hindi naman po namin trabaho.

5423
06:36:47,100 --> 06:36:48,220
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nag-opisina namin yun.

5424
06:36:48,340 --> 06:36:49,620
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pero ginagawa po namin.

5425
06:36:50,780 --> 06:36:52,640
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nagiging trabaho po ng opisina namin.

5426
06:36:52,640 --> 06:36:57,940
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi nanginiwala kami sa walk the extra mile.

5427
06:36:58,600 --> 06:36:58,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: So sana.

5428
06:36:59,020 --> 06:37:00,760
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung po ang hiling namin.

5429
06:37:01,940 --> 06:37:04,540
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Dahil napakadami pong nakakulong ngayon.

5430
06:37:05,160 --> 06:37:06,320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ng matatanda.

5431
06:37:07,240 --> 06:37:08,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Na wala na pong pupuntahan.

5432
06:37:09,180 --> 06:37:09,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Wala silang.

5433
06:37:10,400 --> 06:37:11,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung iba ayaw ng lumaya.

5434
06:37:12,200 --> 06:37:13,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi wala silang pupuntahan.

5435
06:37:14,480 --> 06:37:16,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung may makakausap lang po.

5436
06:37:16,160 --> 06:37:17,060
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Malaking bagay eh.

5437
06:37:17,540 --> 06:37:18,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: May makakausap lang sila.

5438
06:37:19,660 --> 06:37:24,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung pong isang nakakulong sa Pasig na pinuntahan ng opisina namin.

5439
06:37:25,280 --> 06:37:26,580
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang tagal na po pala dun.

5440
06:37:27,400 --> 06:37:28,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ayaw lang niyang lumabas.

5441
06:37:29,020 --> 06:37:31,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kasi wala siyang pupuntahan.

5442
06:37:31,700 --> 06:37:32,300
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pero alam nyo.

5443
06:37:32,400 --> 06:37:33,940
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung may nakausap siya.

5444
06:37:34,180 --> 06:37:35,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nakausap yung pamilya ng tao.

5445
06:37:35,700 --> 06:37:36,320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Naka-uwi po.

5446
06:37:37,100 --> 06:37:39,020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung meron lang pong mag-middleman ba.

5447
06:37:39,160 --> 06:37:41,060
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At lang naniniwala po ako.

5448
06:37:41,140 --> 06:37:42,000
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Trabaho po ninyo.

5449
06:37:42,080 --> 06:37:43,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kung hindi nyo po trabaho yan.

5450
06:37:43,660 --> 06:37:44,680
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pasensya na po kayo.

5451
06:37:45,200 --> 06:37:47,920
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Idagdag na lang po nyo sa ating public service.

5452
06:37:48,760 --> 06:37:50,060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I'm sure po Mr. President.

5453
06:37:50,400 --> 06:37:55,300
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Willing naman po yung National Commission on Senior Citizens to walk that extra mile.

5454
06:37:56,160 --> 06:37:57,400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sa ngayon po.

5455
06:37:57,400 --> 06:38:02,160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Karamihan policy yung ginaganap nilang trabaho.

5456
06:38:02,160 --> 06:38:08,520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero sila na rin po ang may jurisdiction dun sa pagpatupad ng Centenarian Act.

5457
06:38:09,140 --> 06:38:15,500
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At the same time, meron po silang mga commissioners na naka-assign din naman po para sa iba't ibang mga regyon.

5458
06:38:16,400 --> 06:38:23,320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tatanungin ko rin po ngayon kung ano po yung inputs nila tungkol dun sa senior persons with disability.

5459
06:38:23,520 --> 06:38:24,280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Para maidagdag.

5460
06:38:25,200 --> 06:38:26,100
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I'm sorry, what did I say?

5461
06:38:26,140 --> 06:38:26,680
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: PDL po.

5462
06:38:26,800 --> 06:38:27,160
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung mga naka...

5463
06:38:27,400 --> 06:38:28,080
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Nakakulong ko.

5464
06:38:30,540 --> 06:38:30,940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sorry.

5465
06:38:31,860 --> 06:38:35,220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Senior persons deprived of liberty, Mr. President.

5466
06:38:37,640 --> 06:38:38,560
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Boss, konti na lang.

5467
06:38:38,560 --> 06:38:39,140
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Kunti na lang.

5468
06:38:46,360 --> 06:38:54,560
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mr. President, nabanggit ko na rin po kanina na yung isa sa mga private sector organizations

5469
06:38:55,080 --> 06:38:57,380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na may tie-up ang National Commission.

5470
06:38:57,400 --> 06:39:00,400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung senior citizens ay yung Integrated Bar of the Philippines.

5471
06:39:01,620 --> 06:39:12,120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil sa partnership pong iyon, laan po sila na asistihan yung mga senior persons deprived of liberty sa kanilang mga kaso po, Mr. President?

5472
06:39:12,520 --> 06:39:14,680
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: May isang kahilingan na lang po ako.

5473
06:39:15,800 --> 06:39:23,400
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Pwede po bang magsagawa ang DSWD ng isang proposal ng isang...

5474
06:39:24,120 --> 06:39:27,080
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Baka po sakaling isang araw mapondohan natin.

5475
06:39:27,400 --> 06:39:36,660
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ang nursing home at magbigay po kayo ng proposal sa opisina ko at sakali pong ito ay maisusog po natin.

5476
06:40:04,640 --> 06:40:14,180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Speaking of walking the extra mile, Mr. President, magwo one step further ang DSWD,

5477
06:40:14,580 --> 06:40:23,800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: makakapagpadala po sila sa opisina ninyo, design pati costing ng isang hindi lang single residence,

5478
06:40:23,800 --> 06:40:27,280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: pero campo para sa mga pamilya.

5479
06:40:27,400 --> 06:40:34,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Hindi na talaga kayang alagaan ang family member na may early onset demensya.

5480
06:40:35,020 --> 06:40:36,120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At ito po yung...

5481
06:40:36,120 --> 06:40:36,520
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ah, okay.

5482
06:40:37,080 --> 06:40:47,520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sinabit na po nila P249.5 million para sa phase one construction ng home for the elderly sa Oasis Village, Davao de Oro,

5483
06:40:47,920 --> 06:40:52,920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na ang lupa po para dito ay dinonate na po sa department ng LGU, Mr. President.

5484
06:40:52,920 --> 06:40:56,280
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Opo, pakibigay na lang po sa amin na may brother...

5485
06:40:56,280 --> 06:40:57,160
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Magsasabit po sila.

5486
06:40:57,400 --> 06:40:58,200
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Mr. President.

5487
06:40:59,160 --> 06:41:03,360
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Last na lang po ito. Opo, kasi nakatingin na po sa akin si Sen. Joel.

5488
06:41:05,880 --> 06:41:06,820
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Last na po ito.

5489
06:41:08,840 --> 06:41:10,200
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Thank you, parang ikaw. Thank you.

5490
06:41:10,840 --> 06:41:20,820
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Yung pong mga... Marami po kasing tayong inaalagaan ng mga naging biktima po noong shooting sa Tacloban po,

5491
06:41:20,820 --> 06:41:25,180
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: dyan po sa... Ngayon po, kabisita namin yung sa South Cotabato.

5492
06:41:26,280 --> 06:41:27,020
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ah...

5493
06:41:27,020 --> 06:41:31,460
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: May mga tanong lang po ako na ilang beses po ba yung support sa kanila?

5494
06:41:31,580 --> 06:41:33,880
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Isang beses lang po ba yun? Dalawang beses lang?

5495
06:41:33,880 --> 06:41:33,980
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Ano?

5496
06:41:49,900 --> 06:41:53,660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tuloy-tuloy po yung case management, Mr. President.

5497
06:41:54,400 --> 06:41:55,160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ah...

5498
06:41:55,160 --> 06:41:56,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Halimbawa, kamakailan lang...

5499
06:41:57,020 --> 06:42:00,660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dumalaw si Secretary sa South Cotabato.

5500
06:42:01,600 --> 06:42:09,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At doon, of course, yung psychosocial therapy or intervention ay tuloy-tuloy.

5501
06:42:09,940 --> 06:42:12,080
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Nagkaroon ng financial assistance.

5502
06:42:12,320 --> 06:42:15,400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero kung anumang mga forms ng assistance over the years,

5503
06:42:15,400 --> 06:42:20,440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: yan ay sa pamamagitan po ng case management ng assigned social worker.

5504
06:42:21,020 --> 06:42:25,400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At pwede rin pong i-submit ng department sa good gentleman.

5505
06:42:25,540 --> 06:42:26,900
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung mga assistance provided.

5506
06:42:27,020 --> 06:42:29,020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: As of October 2026,

5507
06:42:29,480 --> 06:42:33,620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: dun po sa mga victim-survivors ng nihilistic violent extremism.

5508
06:42:33,620 --> 06:42:38,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: May breakdown po ng financial assistance, psychological first aid,

5509
06:42:38,920 --> 06:42:42,240
Senator Risa Hontiveros: provision of meals, at saka care for the carers din po

5510
06:42:42,240 --> 06:42:49,720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa mga violent incidents sa Tacloban, sa Zamboanga, at saka sa South Cotabato.

5511
06:42:50,100 --> 06:42:56,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero ang total po ng mga kliyente na na-asistehan na po ng departments,

5512
06:42:56,860 --> 06:43:01,540
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa apat na klaseng services na ito, sa tatlong areas na ito,

5513
06:43:01,920 --> 06:43:12,120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ay umaabot na po sila ng 2,587 clients at the cost of 1,057,000 pesos, Mr. President.

5514
06:43:12,360 --> 06:43:12,600
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Apo.

5515
06:43:13,580 --> 06:43:19,320
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Total, nabanggit niyo po yung psychosocial. Napaka-importante po noon.

5516
06:43:19,980 --> 06:43:24,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At sana po, hinihiling ko lang po na patuloy po ninyo silang suportahan,

5517
06:43:24,900 --> 06:43:26,740
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: lalo po yung kanilang pamilya.

5518
06:43:27,440 --> 06:43:29,260
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Dahil kayo po ang inaasahan talaga.

5519
06:43:29,780 --> 06:43:35,900
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: At kami pong lahat ay naniniwala na napakalaki po ng natutulong ng DSWD sa ating mga kababayan.

5520
06:43:36,620 --> 06:43:37,420
Senator Robinhood C. Padilla: Maraming salamat po.

5521
06:43:38,600 --> 06:43:40,960
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sukaran. Maraming salamat din po, Mr. President.

