5533
06:44:26,860 --> 06:44:28,240
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: buong bansa meron eh.

5534
06:44:28,380 --> 06:44:34,920
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: In fact, nag-file po ako ng batas po dito na palawigin, papadamihin yung ganyang mga home for the aged

5535
06:44:34,920 --> 06:44:37,500
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: sa lahat po ng parte ng ating bansa.

5536
06:44:38,080 --> 06:44:44,080
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So, tama ho kayo at maraming salamat po sa inyong pagmamahal po sa kanila.

